cff-version: 1.2.0
title: RoadAnomaly — deep learning for pixel-level road anomaly detection
abstract: >-
  Comparative study of deep learning approaches to anomaly segmentation on the
  RoadAnomaly benchmark: autoencoder reconstruction error, image resynthesis
  (Lis et al., ICCV 2019) and transfer-learned segmentation, served through a
  FastAPI inference service with an Astro landing page and a Streamlit prototype.
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite it and the RoadAnomaly dataset paper
  listed under references.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/adriansalvadorekomo/RoadAnomaly
keywords:
  - anomaly detection
  - semantic segmentation
  - road scenes
  - autonomous driving
  - deep learning
